B08d — dispositions of the 17 reference libc-test failures, 2026-10-13
====================================================================

Scope: the 17 cases that failed in the GCC reference baseline of run
20260927T110110Z. Each case has one source-bound disposition below. A
disposition explains a failure. It does not turn a failure into a PASS. The
original static lane keeps every remaining failure in its failing set and in
its count. No test source, assertion, watchdog, stack limit or descriptor
limit was changed.

