    sha256:e8d52bdced1fa49a5a56cde7e1173c54bd81832cc111441f6a31148ec03ead93
    GCC 14.2.0-19, Clang 19.1.7, dash 0.5.12-12, bash 5.2.37
  Reference archive SHA256, equal to the 2026-09-27 reference archive:
