Claim ceiling: each of the 17 reference failures has a disposition and
evidence. The original static lane still has 13 failing cases: 8 library or
test cases and 5 static-only loader cases. No all-tests PASS, full-musl,
all-EvoCC or B10 claim follows. The patched supplements are a separate
configuration. They never update the original receipt.
